{"name": "The Edge of Water", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">An adventure game about a girl leading her floating village on the course of a great fish migration. Herd sea creatures, protect them from danger, and surf across both beautiful scenery and troubled waters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"42\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/5096d06cc72346de9ae73f37b5760382.webp?t=1779454364\" width=\"308\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Long ago, people lived underwater. Until Su, the life-giving spirit of the sea, cast them out for their betrayal. Now, humans are cursed to walk on the water's surface, unable to reach below it. Yet the sea reaches out, taking and giving as it sees fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/66d8902ad07f521ab408ac673577afb9.poster.avif?t=1779454364\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/66d8902ad07f521ab408ac673577afb9.webm?t=1779454364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/66d8902ad07f521ab408ac673577afb9.mp4?t=1779454364\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"42\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/4474ebed4eadf4527450405dd7b534e3.webp?t=1779454364\" width=\"308\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once in a generation, both humans and fish embark on a great migration towards richer waters. With the sudden loss of her parents, Hedi must take up their role as guides and lead the way for her floating village. A juvenile fish is her steadfast companion in both her journey and her grief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/f465edf302bab5d6e1b549629b327c37.poster.avif?t=1779454364\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/f465edf302bab5d6e1b549629b327c37.webm?t=1779454364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/f465edf302bab5d6e1b549629b327c37.mp4?t=1779454364\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"42\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/828852f1a81310b61283e1a37853b27b.webp?t=1779454364\" width=\"308\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All along the way, fish await the call of the migration. As Hedi, your mission is to find different species and lead them to join the pilgrimage.  Other creatures will stand in your way and you will have to fight off those who mean to harm your herds.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/2d5515fb51fdb4ef67615ecbb448a96e.poster.avif?t=1779454364\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/2d5515fb51fdb4ef67615ecbb448a96e.webm?t=1779454364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/2d5515fb51fdb4ef67615ecbb448a96e.mp4?t=1779454364\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"42\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/extras/6106efee2e11456b2f3bdbe9fba13c5e.webp?t=1779454364\" width=\"308\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience the freedom of the sea with your trusty kite that simultaneously acts as a surfboard, sail, and parachute. Navigate both serene shallows and troubled waters by surfing the waves, jumping above obstacles, and gently gliding through the air.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An adventure game about a girl leading her floating village on the course of a great fish migration. Herd sea creatures, protect them from danger, and surf across both beautiful scenery and troubled waters.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591630/90a3d3bb82ebc47412779db2ecab63340bf8b7dc/header.jpg?t=1779454364", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Atmospheric", "Exploration", "Sailing", "Story Rich", "Nature", "Physics"], "developers": "BigMood", "publishers": "BigMood", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2591630", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/FAidk1iFqCE", "first_seen": 1779055200.0, "review_rank": 612}